[ESPRESSIF SYSTEMS]
Document: ESP32 Technical Reference Manual v4.8
CPU: Dual-core Xtensa 32-bit LX6 240MHz
Memory: 520KB SRAM, 4MB External SPI Flash
Wireless: 802.11 b/g/n Wi-Fi up to 150 Mbps, Bluetooth v4.2 BR/EDR and BLE
Peripherals: 12-bit SAR ADC, 2x 8-bit DAC, 10x touch sensors, SPI, I2S, I2C, UART
Operating Voltage: 3.0V - 3.6V
Status: Public Technical Documentation
